      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tallmadge%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "In the early 1990s, Tallmadge became one of the first Ohio towns to allow retail alcohol sales, later expanding to restaurants in 2001.",
